  "post_content": "<p>La obra de caf&eacute;-teatro &ldquo;Amor Imposible&rdquo; de la compa&ntilde;&iacute;a local Arteatre ha puesto fin esta tarde a la Fireta Solid&agrave;ria en el Casal Jove de Onda.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2011/12/IMG_4022.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>Durante todo el d&iacute;a nueve oeneg&eacute;s de Onda han vendido sus productos para poder financiar sus actividades. Tambi&eacute;n ha habido batucada infantil.</p><div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cafeteatrefiretasolidaria/img_3993.jpg\" alt=\"img_3993\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cafeteatrefiretasolidaria/img_3997.jpg\" alt=\"img_3997\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cafeteatrefiretasolidaria/img_4015.jpg\" alt=\"img_4015\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cafeteatrefiretasolidaria/img_4017.jpg\" alt=\"img_4017\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cafeteatrefiretasolidaria/img_4018.jpg\" alt=\"img_4018\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cafeteatrefiretasolidaria/img_4019.jpg\" alt=\"img_4019\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cafeteatrefiretasolidaria/img_4020.jpg\" alt=\"img_4020\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cafeteatrefiretasolidaria/img_4021.jpg\" alt=\"img_4021\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cafeteatrefiretasolidaria/img_4022.jpg\" alt=\"img_